1960,52,103,22],[32175,19.0,1960,54,93,22]],"links":[["Broadwater County in the Farmland Atlas","/farmland-atlas/montana/broadwater-county"],["ARC or PLC in Broadwater County","/arc-plc/montana/broadwater-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 15 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and November to December came in under 90% of normal in 38 of 75 years, more than any other pair. In 2025 on the middle of the grids, June to July ran 64% of normal. So far in 2026, January to February came in at 54% of normal, and March to April reached 135%. Grid 31273 had its driest year in 2021 at 62%.</p>"}
